---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Business Systems Studio | Static Pulse Sites"
  description="Static Pulse Sites designs websites, automates business workflows, and builds custom internal software for small and medium businesses."
>
  <main>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>We design, automate, and build the systems your business runs on.</h1>

        <p class="lead hero-lead">
          Static Pulse Sites helps small and medium businesses improve their
          websites, connect disconnected tools, reduce repetitive work, and
          build focused internal software around the way they operate.
        </p>

        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
            Start Your Project
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Technology should make your business simpler.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Every project is guided by a real person and designed around the
            business problem you need to solve. You do not need to understand
            programming, automation, or AI before contacting us.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Human Guidance</h3>
            <p>
              We work with you to understand the business before recommending
              technology.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Complete Ownership</h3>
            <p>
              You retain ownership of your website, source code, software,
              and business data.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Practical Solutions</h3>
            <p>
              We use the simplest system that can solve the problem properly.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Connected Operations</h3>
            <p>
              Websites, forms, email, project tools, and internal systems can
              work together.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Security by Design</h3>
            <p>
              We reduce unnecessary dependencies and avoid adding complexity
              that creates additional risk.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Built to Adapt</h3>
            <p>
              Your systems can evolve as your processes, team, and business
              requirements change.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Built for businesses ready to modernize without adding more complexity.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            We work with small and medium businesses that have outgrown manual
            processes, disconnected tools, fragile websites, or generic
            software that does not match the way their teams work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>How the process works.</h2>
        </div>

        <ol class="process-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Get in touch.</strong>
            Tell us what is not working or what you want to improve.
          </li>

          <li>
            <strong>Understand the business.</strong>
            We review your goals, processes, current tools, and constraints.
          </li>

          <li>
            <strong>Design the solution.</strong>
            We recommend the simplest practical approach.
          </li>

          <li>
            <strong>Build and iterate.</strong>
            We build the system and refine it with your feedback.
          </li>

          <li>
            <strong>Launch and improve.</strong>
            We help you put it into use and make improvements as needed.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Three connected ways to improve how your business operates.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Each service can solve a focused problem independently or become
            part of a larger business system.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Website Development</h3>

            <p>
              Fast, secure websites that support your customer journey and
              connect with the systems behind your business.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Starting at $1,200</strong></p>

            <a class="text-link" href="/services/website-development">
              Explore Website Development →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>AI Systems &amp; Automation</h3>

            <p>
              Connected workflows that reduce repetitive work and help
              information move reliably between your existing tools.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Starting at $1,000</strong></p>

            <a class="text-link" href="/services/ai-systems-automation">
              Explore AI Systems &amp; Automation →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Custom Internal Software</h3>

            <p>
              Focused internal tools designed around the way your team manages
              clients, projects, documents, and operations.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Starting at $2,500</strong></p>

            <a class="text-link" href="/services/custom-internal-software">
              Explore Custom Internal Software →
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pricing">
            View Pricing
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-box">
          <h2>What is slowing your business down?</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Tell us about the process, website, or internal system you want to
            improve. You do not need to know which service or technology you
            need before getting in touch.
          </p>

          <div class="button-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
              Start Your Project
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>